# Stack

The app is built by the factory and inherits its stack.

## Decision
Go + Huma + sqlc + pgx + goose; Vite + React + TanStack Router/Query; Tailwind 4 +
@{{org}}/ui {{ui_version}}; Postgres. One binary serving API, MCP, and SPA.

## Alternatives considered
None at app level; the factory decides the stack.

## Consequences
The three surfaces rule and the design system rule apply from the first commit.
